<title>BELGIUM: EU sets unchanged 1997/98 beef intervention price.</title>
<headline>EU sets unchanged 1997/98 beef intervention price.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's standard beef intervention price will remain at 347.5 Ecus per 100 kg carcass weight in 1997/98 (July/June), the EU said in a statement.</p>
<p>EU farm ministers also requested as part of the annual farm price package agreed in Luxembourg on Wednesday that the European Commission urgently examine steps to ensure that the intervention system stops a downward spiral in prices.</p>
<p>The request follows concern from Ireland and other major beef producers.</p>
<p>--Brussels bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
